    },
    "body": "This PR adapts the RCEMIPIIProflle.jl setup to be a more general RCEMIPProfile.jl setup, that allows for both RCEMIPII and RCEMIPI experiments. The only difference between the two experiments are how surface SSTs are treated: RCEMIPII has a constant SST with a surface wave, whereas RCEMIPI has a constant SST, and noise is added to the lowest 5 atmospheric layers with a decreasing amplitude to induce convection. It also adds new documentation for box setups in ClimaAtmos!",
